
msgctxt "L_DISH_008"
msgid "Collect Night Vision from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre la Vue nocturne sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_009"
msgid ""
"Activate the Night Vision.\\nLocate the light switch.\\nTurn the lights back"
" on.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Activer la Vue nocturne.\\nTrouver l'interrupteur.\\nRétablir la lumière.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_010"
msgid "Collect Data Uplink from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre le récepteur sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_011"
msgid "Stand next to the terminal and use the Uplink.\\n"
msgstr "Se tenir près du terminal et utiliser le récepteur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_012"
msgid "You need to be holding the Data Uplink.\\n"
msgstr "Il faut tenir le récepteur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_013"
msgid "Connection established...\\n"
msgstr "Connexion établie...\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_014"
msgid "Terminal has been successfully hacked.\\n"
msgstr "Terminal piraté avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_015"
msgid "Connection broken - too far from PC.\\n"
msgstr "Connexion perdue - trop loin du PC.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_016"
msgid "Collect ECM Mine from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre la mine CME sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_017"
msgid "Locate Hub and throw ECM Mine onto Hub.\\n"
msgstr "Trouver le relais et lancer la mine CME sur le relais.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_018"
msgid "ECM Mine has been placed incorrectly.\\n"
msgstr "Mine CME mal placée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_019"
msgid "ECM Mine has been placed correctly.\\n"
msgstr "Mine CME placée correctement.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_020"
msgid "Collect CamSpy from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre la CamSpy sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_021"
msgid "Locate Info Room PC and holograph it.\\n"
msgstr "Trouver PC de salle Info et holographier.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_022"
msgid "Info Room PC successfully holographed.\\n"
msgstr "Empreinte holographique de PC correcte.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_023"
msgid "Lights have been reactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Lumières réactivées.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_024"
msgid "Collect Door Decoder from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre le décodeur porte sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_025"
msgid "Use Decoder on door pad to unlock it.\\n"
msgstr "Utiliser le décodeur sur la porte pour l'ouvrir.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_026"
msgid "You need to be holding the Door Decoder.\\n"
msgstr "Il faut tenir le décodeur porte.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_027"
msgid "Decoder attached. Initiating cracking routines...\\n"
msgstr "Décodeur fixé. Commandes de piratage lancées...\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_028"
msgid "Decoding complete. Door has been unlocked.\\n"
msgstr "Décodage terminé. Porte déverrouillée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_029"
msgid "Collect Tracker from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre le pisteur sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_030"
msgid "Locate IR Scanner using Tracker.\\n"
msgstr "Trouver le scanner IR grâce au pisteur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_031"
msgid "IR Scanner has been successfully located.\\n"
msgstr "Scanner IR localisé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_032"
msgid "Collect IR Scanner from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre le scanner IR sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_033"
msgid "Locate secret door using IR Scanner.\\n"
msgstr "Trouver la porte secrète grâce au scanner IR.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_034"
msgid "Secret door has been successfully located.\\n"
msgstr "Porte secrète localisée avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_035"
msgid "Collect X-Ray Scanner from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre le scanner rayons X sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_036"
msgid "Find hidden switches to shut down laser grid.\\n"
msgstr "Trouver interrupteurs cachés pour couper grille laser.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_037"
msgid "All laser grids have been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Toutes les grilles laser sont désactivées.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_038"
msgid "Collect Disguise from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre le costume sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_039"
msgid "Fool someone into giving you Cloaking Device.\\n"
msgstr "Tromper quelqu'un pour obtenir un occulteur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_040"
msgid "Cloaking Device successfully retrieved.\\n"
msgstr "Occulteur récupéré avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_041"
msgid "Laser Grid 1 has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Grille laser 1 désactivée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_042"
msgid "Laser Grid 2 has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Grille laser 2 désactivée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_043"
msgid "I'm here to pick up the equipment.\\n"
msgstr "Je viens chercher l'équipement.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_044"
msgid "Go away, Joanna. You're not fooling anybody!\\n"
msgstr "Bonjour, Joanna. Alors comme ça on se déguise?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_045"
msgid "Here you go. Don't drop it now.\\n"
msgstr "Voilà. Ne le faites pas tomber surtout.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_046"
msgid "Cloaking Device has been secured successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Occulteur sécurisé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_047"
msgid "You're meant to use the Disguise, remember?\\n"
msgstr "N'oubliez pas d'utiliser votre costume, d'accord?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_048"
msgid "You'll have to do better than that, Joanna.\\n"
msgstr "Il faudra faire mieux que cela, Joanna.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_049"
msgid "Joanna, where did you spring from?\\n"
msgstr "Joanna, d'où sortez-vous?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_050"
msgid "You have been detected by the camera.\\n"
msgstr "La caméra vous a repérée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_051"
msgid "Collect Cloaking Device from table to begin.\\n"
msgstr "Prendre l'occulteur sur la table pour commencer.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_052"
msgid "Use Cloaking Device and locate Carrington.\\n"
msgstr "Utiliser l'occulteur et localiser Carrington.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_053"
msgid "I think we can safely say your training\\nis now complete!\\n"
msgstr "Aucun doute possible, votre entraînement\\nest terminé!\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_054"
msgid "Mission complete - Device Training passed!\\n"
msgstr "Mission accomplie - Entraînement équipement terminé!\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_055"
msgid "Mission failed - you have been detected.\\n"
msgstr "Mission échouée - vous êtes repérée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_056"
msgid ""
"Select the Uplink.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight Data Uplink and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le Récepteur.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour "
"changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir le récepteur et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_057"
msgid ""
"Select the CamSpy.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight CamSpy and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir la CamSpy.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour "
"changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir la CamSpy et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_058"
msgid ""
"Select the Night Vision.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight Night Vision and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir la Vue nocturne.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick "
"pour changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir Vue nocturne et relâcher A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_059"
msgid ""
"Select the Door Decoder.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight Door Decoder and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le Décodeur porte.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick "
"pour changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir le décodeur porte et relâcher le "
"bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_060"
msgid ""
"Select the X-Ray Scanner.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change"
" selection.\\n- Highlight X-Ray Scanner and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le Scanner rayons X.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le "
"Stick pour changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir le scanner rayons X et relâcher"
" le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_061"
msgid ""
"Select the Disguise.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight Disguise and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le costume.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour "
"changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir le costume et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_062"
msgid ""
"Select the IR Scanner.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight IR Scanner and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le Scanner IR.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour"
" changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir le scanner IR et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_063"
msgid ""
"Select the Tracker.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight Tracker and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le Pisteur.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour "
"changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir le pisteur et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_064"
msgid ""
"Select the Cloaking Device.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to "
"change selection.\\n- Highlight Device and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir l'Occulteur.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour "
"changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir l'occulteur et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_065"
msgid ""
"Select the ECM Mine.\\n- Hold A Button.\\n- Use Control Stick to change "
"selection.\\n- Highlight ECM Mine and release A Button.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir la Mine CME.\\n- Maintenir le bouton A.\\n- Utiliser le Stick pour "
"changer de sélection.\\n- Choisir la mine CME et relâcher le bouton A.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_066"
msgid "Joanna, it's good to see you.\\n"
msgstr "Joanna, quel plaisir de vous voir.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_067"
msgid "Come with me.\\nI'll walk you round the training rooms.\\n"
msgstr "Suivez-moi, Joanna.\\nJe vous emmène aux salles d'entraînement.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_068"
msgid "The information center is through this door.\\n"
msgstr "Le centre d'information est derrière cette porte.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_069"
msgid "In here we have the device lab.\\n"
msgstr "Ici se trouve le labo d'équipement.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_070"
msgid "This leads to the simulant training room.\\n"
msgstr "Par ici se trouve la salle d'entraînement et de simulation.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_071"
msgid "This is the firing range, Jo.\\n"
msgstr "Par là se trouve le champ de tir.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_072"
msgid "This corridor leads down to the hangar.\\n"
msgstr "Ce couloir mène au hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_073"
msgid "HOVERCRATE\\nPress B Button next to Hovcrate to grab it...\\n"
msgstr "CAISSE ANTI-GRAV \\nAppuyer sur B près de la caisse pour la prendre...\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_074"
msgid "Press B Button when crate grabbed to release it.\\n"
msgstr "Appuyer sur B pour relâcher une caisse en main.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_075"
msgid "HOVERBIKE\\nDouble tap B Button next to Hovbike to ride it...\\n"
msgstr "HOVERBIKE \\nDeux fois sur B près de l'Hoverbike pour l'utiliser...\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_076"
msgid "Double tap B Button when on Hovbike to dismount.\\n"
msgstr "Deux fois sur B pour descendre de l'Hoverbike.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_077"
msgid "OPENING DOORS\\nPress B Button next to door to open it.\\n"
msgstr "OUVRIR PORTES \\nAppuyer sur B près d'une porte pour l'ouvrir.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_078"
msgid "B Button will also activate any object nearby.\\n"
msgstr "Le bouton B active aussi un objet proche.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_079"
msgid "ELEVATORS\\nPress B Button next to door to call elevator.\\n"
msgstr "ASCENSEURS \\nAppuyer sur B près de la porte pour appeler l'ascenseur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_080"
msgid "Cannot exit while training is in progress.\\n"
msgstr "Sortie impossible pendant un entraînement.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_081"
msgid "Switch Code 1 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code interrupteur 1 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_082"
msgid "Switch Code 2 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code interrupteur 2 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_083"
msgid "Switch Code 3 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code interrupteur 3 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_084"
msgid "Switch Code 4 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code interrupteur 4 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_085"
msgid "LOOK UP\\n- Press Down C Button to look up at the target.\\n"
msgstr "REGARDER HAUT\\n- Appuyer sur C Bas pour regarder en haut.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_086"
msgid "LOOK DOWN\\n- Press Up C Button to look down at the target.\\n"
msgstr "REGARDER BAS\\n- Appuyer sur C Haut pour regarder en bas.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_087"
msgid "Holoprogram 2 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 2 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_088"
msgid "Holoprogram 4 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 4 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_089"
msgid "Holoprogram 5 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 5 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_090"
msgid "Guard has been successfully disarmed.\\n"
msgstr "Garde désarmé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_091"
msgid "Guard has been successfully knocked out.\\n"
msgstr "Garde neutralisé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_092"
msgid "Disarm this live target if you can.\\n"
msgstr "Désarmez cette cible mouvante si possible.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_093"
msgid "Knock out this target - stealth is the key.\\n"
msgstr "Assomez la cible - mot-clé: furtivité.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_094"
msgid "And the final guard...\\n"
msgstr "Et le dernier garde...\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_095"
msgid "DUCK\\n- Hold R Button, then press Down C Button to duck.\\n"
msgstr "S'ACCROUPIR\\n- Maintenir R puis appuyer sur C Bas pour s'accroupir.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_096"
msgid ""
"CROUCH\\n- When ducking, hold R Button, then press Down C Button to duck.\\n"
msgstr "RAMPER\\n- Une fois accroupie, maintenir R et appuyer sur C bas.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_097"
msgid "Holoprogram 3 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 3 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_098"
msgid "Activate all the switches.\\n"
msgstr "Activer tous les interrupteurs.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_099"
msgid ""
"Activate all of the wall switches.\\n- Be quick, as they will quickly "
"reset.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Activer tous les interrupteurs muraux.\\n- Faire vite ou ils s'éteindront "
"tous.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_100"
msgid ""
"Get the access codes by examining terminals.\\n- Use the codes on the wall "
"terminals.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Examiner les terminaux pour les codes d'accès.\\n- Utiliser les codes sur "
"les terminaux muraux.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_101"
msgid "Code 1 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code 1 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_102"
msgid "Code 2 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code 2 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_103"
msgid "Code 3 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code 3 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_104"
msgid "Code 4 has been obtained.\\n"
msgstr "Code 4 obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_105"
msgid "Training failed - you must face forward.\\n"
msgstr "Entraînement échoué - regarder vers l'avant.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_106"
msgid "Holoprogram 1 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 1 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_107"
msgid ""
"Unarmed combat - knock out the target.\\n- Press Z Button repeatedly to "
"punch.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Combat sans armes - assommer la cible.\\n- Appuyer sur Z plusieurs fois pour"
" se battre.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_108"
msgid "Now try against a moving target...\\n"
msgstr "Essayer maintenant sur une cible mouvante...\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_109"
msgid "And finally against a target that fights back.\\n"
msgstr "Et maintenant contre une cible offensive.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_110"
msgid "Defeat all enemies without getting hit.\\n"
msgstr "Battre tous les ennemis sans subir de dégâts.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_111"
msgid "Training failed - you have been hit.\\n"
msgstr "Entraînement échoué - dégâts subis.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_112"
msgid "Holoprogram 6 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 6 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_113"
msgid "Holoprogram 7 has been completed successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Holoprogramme 7 terminé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_114"
msgid "TERMINALS\\n- Press B Button next to terminal to use it.\\n"
msgstr "TERMINAUX\\n- Appuyer sur B près d'un terminal pour l'utiliser.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_115"
msgid "Now activate the red terminals on the wall.\\n"
msgstr "Activer maintenant les terminaux muraux rouges.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_116"
msgid "PP7\\n"
msgstr "PP7\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_117"
msgid "TT33\\n"
msgstr "TT33\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_118"
msgid "Skorpion\\n"
msgstr "Skorpion\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_119"
msgid "AK47\\n"
msgstr "AK47\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_120"
msgid "Uzi 9mm\\n"
msgstr "Uzi 9mm\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_121"
msgid "MP5K\\n"
msgstr "MP5K\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_122"
msgid "M-16\\n"
msgstr "M-16\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_123"
msgid "FNP90\\n"
msgstr "FNP90\\n"

msgctxt "L_DISH_124"
msgid "Okay, Jo, I'll leave you to prepare for the mission.\\n"
msgstr "OK, Joanna, je vous laisse vous préparer.\\n"
